{"title": "Haystack", "pageid": 55373, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Haystack", "categories": ["Environmental objects"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"name\">Haystack</h2><div class=\"pi-media-collection\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<ul class=\"pi-media-collection-tabs\">\n\t\t<li class=\"pi-tab-link pi-item-spacing current\" data-pi-tab=\"pi-tab-1\">In-game</li><li class=\"pi-tab-link pi-item-spacing\" data-pi-tab=\"pi-tab-2\">Model</li><li class=\"pi-tab-link pi-item-spacing\" data-pi-tab=\"pi-tab-3\">Portrait</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t\t<div class=\"pi-media-collection-tab-content current\" id=\"pi-tab-1\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Waukeens_Rest_Haystack.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"In-game\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Waukeens_Rest_Haystack.png/300px-Waukeens_Rest_Haystack.png.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Waukeens_Rest_Haystack.png/300px-Waukeens_Rest_Haystack.png.webp 1x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Waukeens_Rest_Haystack.png/600px-Waukeens_Rest_Haystack.png.webp 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"In-game\" width=\"270\" height=\"203\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"pi-media-collection-tab-content\" id=\"pi-tab-2\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/w/images/4/49/Haystack_Model.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Model\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Haystack_Model.png/300px-Haystack_Model.png.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Haystack_Model.png/300px-Haystack_Model.png.webp 1x, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Haystack_Model.png/600px-Haystack_Model.png.webp 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Model\" width=\"270\" height=\"240\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"pi-media-collection-tab-content\" id=\"pi-tab-3\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/w/images/3/37/Haystack_Unfaded.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/3/37/Haystack_Unfaded.png\" srcset=\"/w/images/3/37/Haystack_Unfaded.png 1x, /w/images/3/37/Haystack_Unfaded.png 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Portrait\" width=\"144\" height=\"144\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t</div>\n</div></aside>\n<b>Haystack</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Environmental_object\" title=\"Environmental object\">environmental object</a> found in three different locations:\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_One\">Act One</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Emerald_Grove\">Emerald Grove</span></h3>\n<p>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Emerald_Grove\" title=\"Emerald Grove\">Emerald Grove</a>, a haystack is behind the Oxen at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-99&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;619</span>. Approaching it triggers a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;9 Perception Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;9 <a href=\"/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a>, revealing its content on a success.\n</p><p>Its contents can also be revealed by using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Animals\" title=\"Speak with Animals\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/20px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/30px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/40px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Speak with Animals\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/20px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Animals\" title=\"Speak with Animals\">Speak with Animals</a> on the <a href=\"/wiki/Bored_Ox\" title=\"Bored Ox\">Bored Ox</a>. He expresses his annoyance with the <a href=\"/wiki/Tiefling_refugees\" title=\"Tiefling refugees\">tieflings</a> hiding <i>\"shiny bits\"</i> in the hay. Asking about the shiny bits reveals a pouch containing some gold and a gem.\n</p><p>Interacting with the haystack grants 15 XP. \n</p>\n<div class=\"mobileonly\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Emerald_Grove_Haystack.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Emerald_Grove_Haystack.png/300px-Emerald_Grove_Haystack.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Emerald_Grove_Haystack.png/450px-Emerald_Grove_Haystack.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Emerald_Grove_Haystack.png/600px-Emerald_Grove_Haystack.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Emerald_Grove_Haystack.png/300px-Emerald_Grove_Haystack.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4a/Emerald_Grove_Haystack.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>Emerald Grove haystack found by the oxen</figcaption></figure></div>\n<h3><span id=\"Waukeen.27s_Rest\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Waukeen's_Rest\">Waukeen's Rest</span></h3>\n<p>At <a href=\"/wiki/Waukeen%27s_Rest\" title=\"Waukeen's Rest\">Waukeen's Rest</a> a haystack is in the first barn at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-99&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;619</span>. Interacting with it triggers a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;15 Perception Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;15 <a href=\"/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a>. If <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Dead\" title=\"Speak with Dead\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/20px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/30px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/40px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Speak with Dead\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/20px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Dead\" title=\"Speak with Dead\">Speak with Dead</a> is used on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mirileth\" title=\"Mirileth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Portrait_Mirileth.png/25px-Portrait_Mirileth.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Portrait_Mirileth.png/38px-Portrait_Mirileth.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Portrait_Mirileth.png/50px-Portrait_Mirileth.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mirileth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Portrait_Mirileth.png/25px-Portrait_Mirileth.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Portrait_Mirileth.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mirileth\" title=\"Mirileth\">Mirileth</a> before interacting with the Haystack, the DC is reduced to 0, though it can still be failed by rolling a 1 (Critical Failure).\n</p><p>If the perception check is passed, a Gilded Chest is revealed. It contains Mirileth's <a href=\"/wiki/Dowry_Ring\" title=\"Dowry Ring\">Dowry Ring</a>, needed for completing <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rescue_the_Trapped_Man\" title=\"Rescue the Trapped Man\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rescue the Trapped Man\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Rescue_the_Trapped_Man\" title=\"Rescue the Trapped Man\">Rescue the Trapped Man</a>. The chest also contains some gold and a <a href=\"/wiki/Gemstone\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gemstone\">gemstone</a>, piece of <a href=\"/wiki/Valuables_Table\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Valuables Table\">jewlery</a>, chalice, or <a href=\"/wiki/Ingot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ingot\">ingot</a>.\n</p><p>Upon interacting with the haystack, the player character says one of the following lines, depending on who they are<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>:\n</p>\n<div class=\"collapsible-list mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<div style=\"line-height: 1.6em; font-weight: bold;\"><div>Dialogue</div></div>\n<ul class=\"mw-collapsible-content\" style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: inherit; list-style: none; margin-left: 0;\"><li style=\"line-height: inherit; margin: 0\">\nIf the perception check was succesful:\n<ul><li>Looks like there's a chest buried in that hay.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/25px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/38px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/50px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Astarion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/25px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\">Astarion</a>: Very nice. And to think I was expecting a needle.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/38px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/50px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gale\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a>: Look at that: there's a chest hidden in the hay.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/25px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/38px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/50px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Karlach\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/25px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\">Karlach</a>: Hey! There's a chest in here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel\" title=\"Lae'zel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/25px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/38px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/50px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lae'zel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/25px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel\" title=\"Lae'zel\">Lae'zel</a>: Someone's hidden a chest in the hay.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/38px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/50px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadowheart\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a>: There's something hidden in here, in the hay.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/25px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/38px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/50px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wyll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/25px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\">Wyll</a>: Something's hidden in that hay.</li></ul>\nIf the perception check was unsuccesful:\n<ul><li>Surprised this hay hasn't gone up in flames yet.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/25px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/38px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/50px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Astarion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/25px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\">Astarion</a>: Feed for the beasts.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/38px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/50px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gale\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a>: An untouched stack of hay. Mustn't be any horses around.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/25px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/38px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/50px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Karlach\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/25px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\">Karlach</a>: Hay there.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel\" title=\"Lae'zel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/25px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/38px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/50px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lae'zel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/25px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel\" title=\"Lae'zel\">Lae'zel</a>: Horse feed - unburned, for now.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/38px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/50px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadowheart\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a>: You'd think some starving beast would've eaten this hay by now...</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/25px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/38px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/50px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wyll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/25px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\">Wyll</a>: How has this hay not gone up in flames?</li></ul>\n</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mobileonly\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Waukeens_Rest_Haystack.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Waukeens_Rest_Haystack.png/300px-Waukeens_Rest_Haystack.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Waukeens_Rest_Haystack.png/450px-Waukeens_Rest_Haystack.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Waukeens_Rest_Haystack.png/600px-Waukeens_Rest_Haystack.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Waukeens_Rest_Haystack.png/300px-Waukeens_Rest_Haystack.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Waukeens_Rest_Haystack.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>Haystack in the first barn in Waukeen's Rest</figcaption></figure></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_Three\">Act Three</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rivington\">Rivington</span></h3>\n<p>Outside the <a href=\"/wiki/Abandoned_Windmill\" title=\"Abandoned Windmill\">Abandoned Windmill</a> up the hill from <a href=\"/wiki/Arfur%27s_Mansion\" title=\"Arfur's Mansion\">Arfur's Mansion</a> a haystack is at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;56&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-36</span>. Interacting with the haystack triggers a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;25 Investigation Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;25 <a href=\"/wiki/Investigation\" title=\"Investigation\">Investigation</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a>. Succeeding the check adds a single <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arrow_of_Acid\" title=\"Arrow of Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Arrow_of_Acid_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Arrow_of_Acid_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/12/Arrow_of_Acid_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Arrow_of_Acid_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/12/Arrow_of_Acid_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Arrow_of_Acid_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Arrow_of_Acid_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Arrow_of_Acid_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/12/Arrow_of_Acid_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arrow_of_Acid\" title=\"Arrow of Acid\">Arrow of Acid</a> to the player character's inventory, and plays a standard investigation check <a href=\"/wiki/Investigation#Voice_lines\" title=\"Investigation\">voice line</a> for discovering an object.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mobileonly\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Abandoned_Windmill_Haystack.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Abandoned_Windmill_Haystack.png/300px-Abandoned_Windmill_Haystack.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Abandoned_Windmill_Haystack.png/450px-Abandoned_Windmill_Haystack.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Abandoned_Windmill_Haystack.png/600px-Abandoned_Windmill_Haystack.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Abandoned_Windmill_Haystack.png/300px-Abandoned_Windmill_Haystack.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Abandoned_Windmill_Haystack.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>Haystack found by the Abandoned Windmill</figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 335.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 333.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Emerald_Grove_Haystack.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Emerald Grove haystack found by the oxen\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Emerald_Grove_Haystack.png/500px-Emerald_Grove_Haystack.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Emerald_Grove_Haystack.png/751px-Emerald_Grove_Haystack.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4a/Emerald_Grove_Haystack.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Emerald Grove haystack found by the oxen\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Emerald_Grove_Haystack.png/500px-Emerald_Grove_Haystack.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"334\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4a/Emerald_Grove_Haystack.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Emerald Grove haystack found by the oxen</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 252px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 250px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Haystack_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Faded icon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Haystack_Faded.png/375px-Haystack_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/f/f3/Haystack_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Faded icon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Haystack_Faded.png/375px-Haystack_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Haystack_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"galler